obs Five reds of the first hot pass were mine and all five are repaired: a staged sed -i that shell_dialect gates at zero and shell_dialect_touch caught on the INDEX rather than after landing; reds_ledger_headline and reds_ledger_monotone drifting off the new row; and fold_shelf_link_repoint on one link my account shelf carried down a directory when the elder block folded. The headline repair was made by reds_ledger_headline_write.sh write, which is one of the three tools this lap proved converges.
